{"unit_id":"kongxiangyiren__dhs-theme-plugin#card-zh","repo":"kongxiangyiren/dhs-theme-plugin","commit":"9e451e3a9eda86f62c8624d606a911e68a943b16","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Theme Plugin 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的主题管理插件，在设置中加入主题面板。它注册森林绿和海洋蓝两套内置主题，并提供跟随系统、浅色、深色等主题切换。用户可以上传符合指定格式的 JavaScript 主题，修改颜色、加入 CSS 或注册界面组件，也能查看、删除和切换已上传主题。插件通过本地 Host 路由保存主题文件及选择状态，适合希望调整 DSH 网页外观或维护自定义主题的用户；不需要额外配置密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:194-219","lib/client.js:637-685","lib/index.js:143-188"]}
{"unit_id":"kongxiangyiren__dhs-theme-plugin#card-en","repo":"kongxiangyiren/dhs-theme-plugin","commit":"9e451e3a9eda86f62c8624d606a911e68a943b16","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Theme Plugin adds a theme panel to DSH web settings with Forest and Ocean themes, plus system, light, and dark choices. Users can upload JavaScript themes for custom colors, CSS, and UI components, then switch or delete them. Theme files and selection are stored in the local DSH home directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:194-219","lib/client.js:637-685","lib/index.js:143-188"]}
