{"unit_id":"kongxiangyiren__dhs-theme-plugin#feature-1","repo":"kongxiangyiren/dhs-theme-plugin","commit":"9e451e3a9eda86f62c8624d606a911e68a943b16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Theme Plugin 的功能「内置主题切换」：设置页列出系统、浅色、深色以及森林绿和海洋蓝主题；点击选项即可应用，内置主题还会停用已应用的上传主题。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:80-150"]}
{"unit_id":"kongxiangyiren__dhs-theme-plugin#feature-2","repo":"kongxiangyiren/dhs-theme-plugin","commit":"9e451e3a9eda86f62c8624d606a911e68a943b16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Theme Plugin 的功能「上传自定义主题」：用户可从设置页选择 .js 文件，插件读取支持的 bundle 并应用主题；格式可覆盖颜色、注入 CSS 或注册 slots 界面组件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:528-570"]}
{"unit_id":"kongxiangyiren__dhs-theme-plugin#feature-3","repo":"kongxiangyiren/dhs-theme-plugin","commit":"9e451e3a9eda86f62c8624d606a911e68a943b16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Theme Plugin 的功能「自定义主题持久化」：Host 路由保存主题索引和独立脚本文件，浏览器端可读取、切换并在启动时恢复已上传主题。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:50-127"]}
{"unit_id":"kongxiangyiren__dhs-theme-plugin#feature-4","repo":"kongxiangyiren/dhs-theme-plugin","commit":"9e451e3a9eda86f62c8624d606a911e68a943b16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Theme Plugin 的功能「已上传主题管理」：设置页展示上传主题及其应用状态，用户可切换主题或删除条目；切换时会清理旧主题效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:480-591"]}
{"unit_id":"kongxiangyiren__dhs-theme-plugin#caveat-1","repo":"kongxiangyiren/dhs-theme-plugin","commit":"9e451e3a9eda86f62c8624d606a911e68a943b16","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Theme Plugin 会把上传主题脚本和主题索引写入 DSH home 下的 dhs-theme-plugin-themes 与 dhs-theme-plugin.json；上传脚本会在网页中执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:22-24","lib/index.js:62-65","lib/client.js:253-272"]}
